          "settings": {
            "heading": "Product Description",
            "icon": "clipboard",
            "content": "<h5>Elevate your beach trips, pool days, and outdoor adventures with this versatile Drawstring Mesh Beach Backpack. Crafted from durable nylon and polyester net materials, it’s designed to keep your gear organized, dry, and easy to carry.</h5><h5>With a breathable mesh design for quick drying, a secure drawstring closure, and thoughtful additions like a zippered front pocket, external water bottle holder, and adjustable shoulder straps, this bag offers unmatched convenience and comfort. Perfect for towels, snorkel gear, swimsuits, and more, it’s the ultimate go-to for all your on-the-go needs.</h5>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
