          "settings": {
            "heading": "Key Features",
            "icon": "star",
            "content": "<h5><strong>Durable Materials</strong>: Made with strong nylon and polyester net for long-lasting use.</h5><h5><strong>Breathable Mesh Design</strong>: Ensures wet gear dries quickly while keeping sand out.</h5><h5><strong>Zippered Front Pocket</strong>: Securely store small essentials like keys or sunscreen.</h5><h5><strong>External Water Bottle Holder</strong>: Stay hydrated with easy-access storage.</h5><h5><strong>Adjustable Shoulder Straps</strong>: Comfortable and convenient for hands-free carrying.</h5><p></p><p></p><p><strong>Spacious Main Compartment</strong>: Plenty of room for towels, beach gear, and more.</p><p></p><p></p><p></p>",
